":"S☆猫","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:185254","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Yukacco","creatorId":"vndb:s23947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23947","name":"Yukacco","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:185256","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c109487","characterName":"小瀬 葉月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112280","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"383523"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24198"],"vndbCharacterId":"c109487"},"originalCharacterName":"小瀬 葉月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Doting Senpai Next Door"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hazuki is the daughter of the landlord who lives next to Arata. As such, she takes the protagonist under her wing, always looking for ways to support him. With a heart of gold, she's the go-to person for advice and never hesitates to lend a helping hand. Hazuki is also actively involved in the local community."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Don't let her easygoing demeanor fool you, though—she's got a spine of steel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"As your neighbor, my door is always open. So feel free to come to me with anything, anytime.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Point: Basking in the tender loving care of a doting senpai"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Going home style: Detour. When walking home, Hazuki marches to the beat of her own drum. Embarking on a solo adventure daily, letting her whims guide her path."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c109487"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の隣に住んでいる家主の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公の事を気にかけ、何かと世話を焼こうとしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相談事にもすぐ乗ってしまうお人好しでもあり、地域活動にも積極的に関わるくらいのアクティブさを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のほほんとした外見に見合わず芯は強くはっきりしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24198","sourceWorkId":"32784","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の隣に住んでいる家主の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公の事を気にかけ、何かと世話を焼こうとしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相談事にもすぐ乗ってしまうお人好しでもあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地域活動にも積極的に関わるくらいのアクティブさを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のほほんとした外見に見合わず芯は強くはっきりしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112280"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/28e58a6a9aabb392c1a4ade3721dd058c8626d53f8fb45da71d15fe92d18d41d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/708d8c3118fe178fe8c609821e88f8de0db73d838b683ee666f9d2bb92ae376f.webp","width":87,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎未來","creatorId":"vndb:s986","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s986","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s986","name":"尾崎 未來","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:383523:112280:13776:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c109794","characterName":"夏越 千穂","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112281","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"383523"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24199"],"vndbCharacterId":"c109794"},"originalCharacterName":"夏越 千穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Beloved Mascot-like Classmate"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A classmate in Arata's new school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having a warm and welcoming demeanor, Chiho and Arata quickly become friends. With her warm and friendly personality, she easily wins the hearts of those around her, becoming the class's beloved mascot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiho's positive outlook on life allows her to find joy in every situation, and her genuine emotions and sensitivity make her easily moved by the things she notices."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Look! Look! The sunset is so pretty!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Point: Basking in the affection of a friendly girl"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Going home style: In a group. Chiho typically walks home with two friends, forming a lively trio, and their route is unpredictable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c109794"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の転入先の同級生。人懐っこい性格をしていて、すぐ主人公とも仲良くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何でも明るく捉える前向きな性格は周囲の反応も良く、クラスのマスコット的存在でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心や感受性も強く、色々な物事に気付き、大きく感動出来きるくらい自分の感情に対しても素直。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24199","sourceWorkId":"32784","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の転入先の同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこい性格をしていて、すぐ主人公とも仲良くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何でも明るく捉える前向きな性格は周囲の反応も良く、クラスのマスコット的存在でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心や感受性も強く、色々な物事に気付き、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大きく感動出来きるくらい自分の感情に対しても素直。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/90d5a25beac0e67d043aa6d2cfb682b0e407ee92306122a5c1ed10d42b899761.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21cb94a4196b18bb8622056c52f86522f17611648286305996df4140fc032c30.webp","width":132,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚木雪那","creatorId":"vndb:s22613","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22613","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22613","name":"柚木 雪那","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:383523:112281:44177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c110150","characterName":"車井 みくる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"383523"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24200"],"vndbCharacterId":"c110150"},"originalCharacterName":"車井 みくる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Enigmatic Beauty Behind the Mask"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Arata's classmate in his new school, Mikuru, is not much of a talker and rarely shows her emotions. Coupled with the fact that she's always wearing a mask, she's definitely someone who stands out in class. Mikuru doesn't put on airs to impress anyone, and her unique vibe has earned her the reputation of being an icy, unapproachable beauty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Point: Ego boosts from dating such a mysterious and captivating presence"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Going home style: Systematic. There is a regular pattern to what she does and when."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Going home with me isn't fun, is it?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110150"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の転入先の同級生。あまり喋ったり感情を出したりしない上に、いつもマスクをしている事も相まってクラスでは一目置かれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人に媚びる姿も見せないため、独特の雰囲気も相まってクール系美女の称号を得ている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24200","sourceWorkId":"32784","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の転入先の同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり喋ったり感情を出したりしない上に、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもマスクをしている事も相まってクラスでは一目置かれる存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人に媚びる姿も見せないため、独特の雰囲気も相まってクール系美女の称号を得ている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112282"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e048dbb4794a60abaef7406081d8036548ae8c4fe21b00e5a2ca5703359e1013.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e42b17cbd65d70c83db7d69166e4c1a159cf3637fd62b5da0eb28a1cfbea072.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"又吉愛","creatorId":"vndb:s1646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1646","name":"又吉 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:383523:112282:5013:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c110682","characterName":"渡良瀬 寧々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112283","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"383523"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24201"],"vndbCharacterId":"c110682"},"originalCharacterName":"渡良瀬 寧々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Sassy Junior"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meet Nene, a spunky first-year who's keenly interested in Arata. She's always finding ways to get under his skin, and with her bold and sassy attitude, it's no wonder they butt heads more often than not. But don't let Nene's feisty exterior fool you—once she sees eye to eye with you, she's all ears."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Whoa, Senpai, what's the deal? No squad to hang with?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Point: The pleasure of besting a cheeky younger girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Going home style: Stalking. Nene trails behind Arata, keeping a watchful eye from afar."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the Official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110682"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じ学園に通う１年生。何故か主人公に興味を抱きやたら絡んでくるのだがとにかく生意気で好戦的な性格をしているためよく押し問答になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、納得すればちゃんと言う事を聞く素直さも持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24201","sourceWorkId":"32784","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じ学園に通う1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何故か主人公に興味を抱きやたら絡んでくるのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とにかく生意気で好戦的な性格をしているためよく押し問答になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"けれど、納得すればちゃんと言う事を聞く素直さも持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112283"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1e1403c84303ac9d3b6529df37d55a2015f8075499a3e1618f6a7e23ac7d35e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71c92d9de983c36a8e3c9b033339920c72427d2e4183820248351b6a97862a01.webp","width":95,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:383523:112283:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c110736","characterName":"窓川 芹香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112285","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"383523"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24202"],"vndbCharacterId":"c110736"},"originalCharacterName":"窓川 芹香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Enigmatic Student from Another School"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An intriguing student whom Arata met from a different school during the daily train commute. With a mischievous and playful personality, Serika takes delight in playfully teasing others. Her intelligence and quick wit make it a formidable challenge for Arata to gain the upper hand in their interactions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Oh my, are you blushing?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Point: At the mercy of her sadistic tease"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Going home style: Commuting by train. Attending different schools limits their opportunities for contact, with their encounters primarily occurring during their shared train commute."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110736"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"通学時の電車内で見かける不思議な雰囲気を持った他校の生徒。いたずら好きですぐからかってくる小悪魔系な性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強も出来、頭の回転も早いので主人公側が主導権を握るのはなかなかに大変。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24202","sourceWorkId":"32784","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"通学時の電車内で見かける不思議な雰囲気を持った他校の生徒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いたずら好きですぐからかってくる小悪魔系な性格をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強も出来、頭の回転も早いので主人公側が主導権を握るのはなかなかに大変。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112285"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8fae76d5112f05b931fed3cad12c51b5ed591504b0593c5c9907656ed310131.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ca5d925dfae0840005aa30d48d1c8cdad8d725a2883212e5abc9af288257957.webp","width":86,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鹿瀬紫卯","creatorId":"vndb:s8642","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8642","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8642","name":"鹿瀬紫卯","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:383523:112285:56841:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c111186","characterName":"公住 新","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c111186"},"originalCharacterName":"公住 新","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c121606","characterName":"宮下 愛","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c121606"},"originalCharacterName":"宮下 愛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Their parents named her and her brother after the motto \"love&peace\", which is why her name is written with the Kanji \"Ai\" but read as \"Love\". Because she is embarassed about the name, she forces everyone to call her Ai instead. Together with Yoru she is best friends with Chiho, albeit being in a different class, and often helps out saving/straightening out Chiho when she goes berserk or clumsily tilts over, nearly causing her to fall down."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c121606"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55ef4b030505108be83564201d6ae3f611f7deb301dcafae50e47e4c1b7b7563.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85d7b85037ae9b936c2a1644a0633c6a323653a39164267ce4d6ad71d21bd711.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葉月 ひかり","creatorId":"vndb:s24678","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24678","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24678","name":"葉月 ひかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:91363","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c121607","characterName":"山内 夜乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c121607"},"originalCharacterName":"山内 夜乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"